# One entry per line.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# 1) A raw DeepSeek web token (from localStorage: userToken):
# 8f3a...your...token...
#
# 2) Optional auto-login (email:password). The proxy logs in on first use,
#    gets a fresh token and keeps it in memory:
# user@example.com:your-password
#
# Multiple tokens are rotated round-robin. A token that returns 401/403 is
# put on cooldown for TOKEN_COOLDOWN_MS.

# replace-me-with-a-real-token